          "Antal, Botond B., et al. Brain aging shows nonlinear transitions, suggesting a midlife “critical window” for metabolic intervention., Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences 122.10 (2025): e2416433122. https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.2416433122"
